usage: treeneuron [-h]
                  {doctor,verify-math,verify-baselines,run,report,audit,seal-archive,calibrate,freeze,prepare-cohort,confirm,analyze-primary,amend}
                  ...

positional arguments:
  {doctor,verify-math,verify-baselines,run,report,audit,seal-archive,calibrate,freeze,prepare-cohort,confirm,analyze-primary,amend}
    doctor              Record local prerequisite observations
    verify-math         Validate CPU references, package math and actual
                        backend kernels/batching
    verify-baselines    Execute bounded causal control correctness recipes
    run                 Execute a complete exploratory paired study (G/V only)
    report              Rebuild exploratory metrics from retained artifacts
    audit               Audit complete frozen evidence or a sealed saved-
                        evidence archive
    seal-archive        Copy validated live evidence before amendment/source
                        drift
    calibrate           Run bounded exploratory pilots; scientific purpose
                        requires verified readiness
    freeze              Freeze a verified canonical scientific design
    prepare-cohort      Prepare new F/G/V and T row commitments before freeze
    confirm             Execute the complete validated frozen synthetic cohort
    analyze-primary     Rebuild teacher-level analysis from sealed rows
    amend               Preserve old identity and require fresh confirmation

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
